      "privatePressure": "皇帝信任是资源也是绳索，失败会同时被解释成误国或欺瞒。",
      "keyLeverage": "解读急递并决定哪些总督资源必须预留",
      "defaultPrepare": "阅读急递并保留军政余量",
      "defaultCommit": "接受不可撤销的国策压力",
      "dialogueSeeds": [
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.p0.zhejiang_governor.01",
          "text": "“这道急递只写要银要丝，却没写浙江的粮从哪里补。”",
          "purpose": "PROBE_OR_FRAME",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.sangtian_edict",
            "obj.fiscal_gap",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.p0.zhejiang_governor.02",
          "text": "“先把能动的粮、兵和驿路列清，别用一句奉旨遮住后账。”",
          "purpose": "BARGAIN_OR_THREAT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.sangtian_edict",
            "obj.fiscal_gap",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        },
        {
          "dialogueSeedId": "dialogue.p0.zhejiang_governor.03",
          "text": "“我可以担催办，谁来担百姓改了桑以后明年的口粮？”",
          "purpose": "HANDOFF_OR_COMMITMENT",
          "signatureLine": false,
          "applicableObjectIds": [
            "obj.sangtian_edict",
            "obj.fiscal_gap",
            "obj.governor_command_seal"
          ],
          "knownBy": [
            "seat.zhejiang_governor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "privateOpening": "胡宗宪拆开急递时，案上只有财政缺口、丝绸任务和自己必须承担的地方后果。皇帝的信任让他能调度，也让任何失败都更像欺瞒。",
